<br class="ltx_break"><span id="alg1.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output: </span> Model Weights <math id="alg1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W=\{W_{1},...,W_{L}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W=\{W_{1},...,W_{L}\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
